T*
(Metres then the garden slopes upwards from there up to 74 Market Lane\054 Bessacarr\054 Doncaster\054 ZZ63 7KS\056 I) Tj
T*
(approximate that where the dwelling is planned the base of the building will already be 1\0565 Metres higher than) Tj
T*
(the base of our home\056 This will effectively make the building very imposing with a height of 8\0565\053 Metres and) Tj
T*
(only feet awayXXXXXXX\056 Our home as a point of reference is approximately 7\0565 Metres high\056 The dwelling) Tj
T*
(would also block out any sunlight XXXXX With the cooperation of the previous owner a Beech hedge was put) Tj
T*
(at the bottom of the garden along with concrete slabs as the aforementioned drop was causing land slips as it) Tj
T*
(is a 1\0562m vertical drop and we were experiencing land slips most winters or after heavy rain\056 Were this land to) Tj
T*
(be altered in any way we would fear the return of land slippage\056 The aspect of the dwelling XXXXX has three) Tj
T*
(windows\056 The window in bedroom 2 will be around 5\0556m above the base level XXXXXXXX\056 This would be a) Tj
